{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:35Z","created_by_operation":"op_52d94c9fc1fe4f19a5746a7518e87c07","id":"pg_6df8041672125076bf8b097e71dc834e","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/vectorize-io-hindsight-contributing-md-e3efe5dd8b07-097e71dc834e.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_c7b99e7df2d95f5c9f00c729da8e8b8a"],"title":"vectorize-io/hindsight/CONTRIBUTING.md @ e3efe5dd8b07","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:35Z","updated_by_operation":"op_52d94c9fc1fe4f19a5746a7518e87c07"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_21ed2cba4593d075dddb8757589e83cf5472d4450719b58abe6a52ffb5469cbc"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"An opt-in per-bank Memory Defense policy scans retains against 45 secret/PII patterns, redacting or blocking matches before storage."},{"claim_ids":["clm_36dadd9593f754dc35d89903a42ebdca38233f6403be6623675f8a78b3733a9f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Recall runs four retrieval strategies in parallel (semantic vector, BM25 keyword, graph, temporal) and merges results with reciprocal rank fusion plus cross-encoder reranking."},{"claim_ids":["clm_3e4cbb355de874596d82c4ee30bd04d4d005fce008658155d2c281e715401fe4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A coding-agents package builds a per-repo memory bank from git history and past sessions, injected into supported CLI coding agents with automatic ingestion."},{"claim_ids":["clm_42688d4ec4e4156ef475f01f6d4a1056b5c8d4b1d7eb03f9115afba11122d178"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Mental models are standing answers to defined questions that are rewritten in the background and readable as a plain database read without retrieval or an LLM call."},{"claim_ids":["clm_54fd7d6a0a9e0a4a96eb6cdc9e2a6626bc9bd5c82d3cb50bdc942b66f828f9bd"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Hindsight is described as an agent memory system aimed at agents that learn over time, not merely recall conversation history."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6ce50761c934b014f7de1da4bd3a3a4a0fdadf31cdd8b8014f266b6b8b755142"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Storage uses PostgreSQL with pgvector, or Oracle AI Database 23ai with claimed full feature parity for enterprise deployments."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9241421a8ecd39b18cccf70671b5bf207ba19ef11c9e632d7b6f8d81b0bc11cc"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Every server ships a built-in MCP endpoint, one per bank, at /mcp/{bank_id}/, exposing retain, recall and reflect as tools to any MCP client."},{"claim_ids":["clm_956dc963185b967a803a9338a04721e0cf3db04aa0cb56634804fd7112d23a71"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Hindsight targets conversational and autonomous agents needing personalization and learning, and may be overkill for simple n8n-style workflows."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a179d096f2edb1040ba27f1b79370b451801209b47d5063606c74270db1984c2"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Banks carry disposition traits such as skepticism, literalism and empathy that shape how reflect reasons, and strict isolation prevents cross-bank leakage."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b4f175733345b07bb0447e33cb7be1251d7d8d68fdb30f6abe0106a7fb5f6fbf"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Background consolidation builds observations that keep supporting evidence with exact quotes and a proof count, and are refined rather than overwritten as new evidence arrives."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c3bec46a6430ab1fa6e0f1d320271f4f4f89a78f6fcaeced58161fdb402717e0"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The server supports 25+ LLM providers via HINDSIGHT_API_LLM_PROVIDER, including hosted, local (ollama, lmstudio, llamacpp), OpenAI-compatible endpoints, and subscription-based options."},{"claim_ids":["clm_cc9483d8ef4e10025356da709297133ee8d402e71569d0abd6cc43a78f4cc2bd"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The product exposes three core operations: retain (store), recall (search), and reflect (deeper analysis), callable via Python, Node.js, Go, CLI, and REST clients."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e153d7f87219fcd4417011ce448c344ff1ae314dc8f0d528b554c214eaa88847"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The README reports state-of-the-art LongMemEval benchmark results, with live per-model accuracy, latency and cost published on a benchmarks site and independent reproduction claimed by Virginia Tech and The Washington Post."},{"claim_ids":["clm_fd3d04ced8ef569369beb4a7b7ab4a76ec289c92df2bc034036633c23f4911a5"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Memories are organized into four types: world facts, experiences, observations, and mental models, stored in isolated banks."}],"claim_ids":["clm_21ed2cba4593d075dddb8757589e83cf5472d4450719b58abe6a52ffb5469cbc","clm_36dadd9593f754dc35d89903a42ebdca38233f6403be6623675f8a78b3733a9f","clm_3e4cbb355de874596d82c4ee30bd04d4d005fce008658155d2c281e715401fe4","clm_42688d4ec4e4156ef475f01f6d4a1056b5c8d4b1d7eb03f9115afba11122d178","clm_54fd7d6a0a9e0a4a96eb6cdc9e2a6626bc9bd5c82d3cb50bdc942b66f828f9bd","clm_6ce50761c934b014f7de1da4bd3a3a4a0fdadf31cdd8b8014f266b6b8b755142","clm_9241421a8ecd39b18cccf70671b5bf207ba19ef11c9e632d7b6f8d81b0bc11cc","clm_956dc963185b967a803a9338a04721e0cf3db04aa0cb56634804fd7112d23a71","clm_a179d096f2edb1040ba27f1b79370b451801209b47d5063606c74270db1984c2","clm_b4f175733345b07bb0447e33cb7be1251d7d8d68fdb30f6abe0106a7fb5f6fbf","clm_c3bec46a6430ab1fa6e0f1d320271f4f4f89a78f6fcaeced58161fdb402717e0","clm_cc9483d8ef4e10025356da709297133ee8d402e71569d0abd6cc43a78f4cc2bd","clm_e153d7f87219fcd4417011ce448c344ff1ae314dc8f0d528b554c214eaa88847","clm_fd3d04ced8ef569369beb4a7b7ab4a76ec289c92df2bc034036633c23f4911a5"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:35Z","created_by_operation":"op_52d94c9fc1fe4f19a5746a7518e87c07","id":"pg_720ff911fed352b893b0169804b5e351","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/vectorize-io-hindsight-readme-md-e3efe5dd8b07-169804b5e351.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_bb4f92f02d1c5bafaf835c92f74d417d"],"title":"vectorize-io/hindsight/README.md @ e3efe5dd8b07","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:30:35Z","updated_by_operation":"op_52d94c9fc1fe4f19a5746a7518e87c07"}
